Package: baas-capture-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: BAAS project <baas@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-fprint-2.0, libfprint-2-2
Recommends: zenity, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Invalid8/baas-capture-agent
Description: Use a U.are.U 4500 fingerprint reader from web pages
 Local service on 127.0.0.1:7501 that reads a fingerprint image from a
 DigitalPersona / HID U.are.U 4500 (libfprint uru4000 driver) and hands it to
 web pages as a 500 ppi PNG. Blank or faint presses are asked again, a new
 site must be allowed once on screen, and http://127.0.0.1:7501 shows a
 self-check page with a test capture.
